SUMMARY:Chris O'Connor LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DTSTAMP:20260731T111639Z
DTSTART:20260731T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nChris O’Connor is a fast-rising stand-up comedian who has been making
	 waves on the national comedy club circuit with his sharp\, conversational
	 style and razor-sharp wit. \nKnown for his appearances at top clubs like 
	Goodnights Comedy Club in Raleigh and Wiseguys Comedy Club\, O’Connor deli
	vers a brand of comedy that blends clever wordplay with honest\, relatable
	 storytelling. His material covers everything from everyday awkwardness to
	 deeper observations about modern life. \nWith a growing fanbase and a pac
	ked 2026 tour schedule\, Chris O’Connor is one of the most exciting names 
	to watch in stand-up comedy right now. Don’t miss your chance to see him l
	ive in Houston. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:
	00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Ca
	roline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ (2 Beverage Minim
	um per person)\nTicket Prices: $38 – $50 (fees included)\n\nAbout the Venu
	e\nPunch Line Houston is downtown Houston’s premier stand-up comedy destin
	ation\, located at 1204 Caroline Street in the heart of the city. This Liv
	e Nation-operated club brings world-class comedians to an intimate\, energ
	etic setting that makes every show feel personal. \nThe venue features a g
	eneral admission floor with preferred seating upgrades available. Every se
	at offers a great sightline to the stage\, and the full-service bar ensure
	s you’re well-stocked for a night of laughs. The 2-beverage minimum per pe
	rson is standard at this club. \nParking options include valet service (av
	ailable at most shows) and the nearby Green Street garage on Clay between 
	Main and Fannin\, which offers skybridge access to the venue. The club is 
	cashless — credit and debit cards only. \nWhat to Expect\nFriday night at 
	Punch Line Houston is always a great time\, and Chris O’Connor’s early sho
	w is the perfect way to start your weekend. Expect a tight\, polished set 
	filled with clever observations\, audience interaction\, and genuine laugh
	s from start to finish. \nDoors open one hour before showtime\, so plan to
	 arrive early to get settled and order your first round. The show runs app
	roximately 90 minutes. A late show at 9:15 PM is also available for those 
	who prefer a later start. \nCell phones\, video recording\, and photograph
	y are not permitted during the performance. The venue enforces a strict no
	-heckling policy to ensure the best experience for all guests. \nTicket In
	formation\nTickets are priced from $38 to $50 (all-in pricing\, fees inclu
	ded before taxes). Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find 
	resale options on VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post
	 contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to yo
	u.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/chris-oconnor-live-at-punch-line-ho
	uston/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chris-oconnor-live-at-punch-line-houst
	on/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\,
	 United States
