DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nPat McGann LIVE at Birchmere\nOne of comedy’s fast
	est-rising stars\, Pat McGann\, is coming to the legendary Birchmere in Al
	exandria\, VA for a night of hilarious stand-up comedy! Known for his shar
	p wit\, relatable storytelling\, and infectious energy\, Pat McGann delive
	rs a show that will have the whole room laughing from start to finish. \nE
	vent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM ET (Doors open 
	at 6:00 PM\, Seating begins at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Birchmere\nAddress: 3701 M
	t. Vernon Ave\, Alexandria\, VA 22305\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome\n
	Parking: Plenty of free\, secure on-site parking available \nAbout Pat McG
	ann\nPat McGann is a Chicago-based comedian who has quickly risen through 
	the ranks to become one of the most talked-about voices in stand-up comedy
	. He has appeared on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon and has toured
	 extensively across the country\, earning rave reviews for his sharp\, sel
	f-deprecating humor and hilarious takes on family life and everyday situat
	ions. His debut album debuted at #1 on the iTunes comedy charts. \nWhat to
	 Expect\n\nSharp\, witty stand-up comedy from one of the hottest rising st
	ars in the game\nHilarious storytelling about family\, relationships\, and
	 everyday life\nAn intimate\, world-class comedy experience at the legenda
	ry Birchmere\nSelf-deprecating humor that is both relatable and brilliantl
	y crafted\nA perfect summer night out with friends or a date\nAn evening y
	ou’ll be quoting and laughing about for weeks to come\n\nVenue Information
	\nThe Birchmere is America’s legendary music hall\, a beloved 500-seat int
	imate venue in Alexandria\, Virginia\, established in 1966. Known for its 
	exceptional sound quality\, comfortable seating\, and warm atmosphere\, th
	e Birchmere is one of the most cherished entertainment venues in the DC me
	tro area. \nTicket Information\nTickets are $45 (face value) with service 
	fees through Ticketmaster at $58.95\, or $52 at the Birchmere Box Office. 
	Tickets are limited — only 30 remaining on VividSeats — so grab yours befo
	re they’re gone! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains a
	ffiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our l
	inks at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to 
	change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalenda
	r.com/event/pat-mcgann-live-at-birchmere/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
