SUMMARY:James Austin Johnson LIVE at Punch Line Philly
DTSTAMP:20260731T111639Z
DTSTART:20260731T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJames Aus
	tin Johnson is one of the most exciting comedic talents to emerge from Sat
	urday Night Live in years. A featured player on SNL since 2021\, Johnson h
	as earned widespread acclaim for his uncanny impressions of political figu
	res — most notably his portrayals of Presidents Biden and Trump\, which Va
	nity Fair called the “best Trump impersonation of all.” \nEntertainment We
	ekly described him as “a cross between Dana Carvey and Darrell Hammond\,” 
	and his work on SNL has made him a household name among comedy fans. Beyon
	d impressions\, Johnson is a sharp\, versatile stand-up comedian with a na
	tural stage presence and a gift for storytelling. \nJohnson has also appea
	red in film and television\, including the Coen Brothers’ Hail\, Caesar! (
	2016) and the AMC hit series Better Call Saul. His multi-city comedy tour\
	, The Age of JAJ\, has been selling out venues across the country — and no
	w he’s bringing the laughs to Philadelphia. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\
	, July 31\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM EDT \nVenue: Punch Line Philly — 33 E. La
	urel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restriction: 21+ with 2-bevera
	ge minimum \nTicket Prices: Starting from $38 (plus fees) \nAbout the Venu
	e\nPunch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s premier stand-up comedy club\, loca
	ted in the heart of the Northern Liberties neighborhood at 33 E. Laurel St
	reet. The intimate venue seats approximately 300 guests and offers an up-c
	lose\, personal comedy experience unlike any large arena show. \nThe club 
	features a full bar and two-drink minimum\, table seating arranged in a cl
	assic comedy club layout\, and excellent sightlines from every seat in the
	 house. The atmosphere is lively and welcoming\, making it the perfect spo
	t for a date night\, birthday celebration\, or a fun night out with friend
	s. \nPunch Line Philly is part of the nationally recognized Punch Line Com
	edy Club brand and regularly hosts some of the biggest names in stand-up c
	omedy. Parking is available nearby\, and the venue is easily accessible vi
	a public transit. Doors typically open 30–45 minutes before showtime. \nWh
	at to Expect\nJames Austin Johnson’s live show is a masterclass in comedic
	 performance. Audiences can expect a full evening of stand-up comedy that 
	blends sharp political satire\, pop culture observations\, and his legenda
	ry celebrity impressions — all delivered with the energy and polish of a s
	easoned SNL performer. \nThe show typically features an opening act before
	 JAJ takes the stage for his headlining set. Fans who have seen him live r
	ave about his ability to go beyond the impressions and deliver genuinely f
	unny\, original material that keeps the crowd laughing from start to finis
	h. \nThis is a 21+ event with a two-beverage minimum per person. Arrive ea
	rly to grab your drinks\, find your seats\, and enjoy the full experience.
	 Shows at Punch Line Philly tend to sell out quickly\, especially for high
	-profile headliners like JAJ. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $38 – $75
	 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and V
	ividSeats (resale). Secure your seats before they sell out! \nOfficial Tic
	ketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a com
	mission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/james
	-austin-johnson-live-at-punch-line-philly/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/james-austin-johnson-live-at-punch-lin
	e-philly/
LOCATION:Punch Line Philly\, 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 1912
	3\, United States
