SUMMARY:Nate Bargatze: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour LIVE at Van Andel Arena (Ma
	tinee)
DTSTAMP:20260731T111640Z
DTSTART:20260801T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Nate Barga
	tze\nNate Bargatze is one of the biggest names in stand-up comedy today. K
	nown as “The Great American” of comedy\, the Nashville-born comedian has b
	uilt a massive following through his clean\, relatable humor that appeals 
	to audiences of all ages and backgrounds. \nBargatze has released multiple
	 acclaimed Netflix specials including The Tennessee Kid\, The Greatest Ave
	rage American\, and Hello World. His wholesome\, self-deprecating style an
	d masterful storytelling have earned him comparisons to comedy legends lik
	e Brian Regan and Jim Gaffigan. \nThe Big Dumb Eyes World Tour is his bigg
	est tour yet\, selling out arenas across the globe. Grand Rapids is gettin
	g two shows on August 1 — this is the 3:00 PM matinee performance. \nEvent
	 Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026 \nTime: 3:00 PM (Matinee Show) 
	\nVenue: Van Andel Arena\, 130 Fulton West\, Grand Rapids\, MI 49503 \nAge
	 Restriction: All ages (family-friendly content) \nTicket Prices: Starting
	 from $57 \nAbout Van Andel Arena\nVan Andel Arena is Grand Rapids’ larges
	t and most iconic entertainment venue\, located at 130 Fulton West in the 
	heart of downtown. With a capacity of approximately 12\,000\, it hosts the
	 biggest concerts\, sporting events\, and comedy shows that come through W
	est Michigan. \nThe arena features multiple seating levels including floor
	\, lower bowl\, and upper bowl sections\, multiple concession stands and b
	ars\, and ample parking in nearby downtown structures. The venue is easily
	 accessible from US-131 and I-196\, and is surrounded by downtown Grand Ra
	pids’ vibrant restaurant and bar scene. \nA matinee comedy show at Van And
	el Arena is a fantastic afternoon outing for the whole family or a group o
	f friends. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headline stand-up show featuri
	ng Nate Bargatze performing his full set. Expect approximately 75–90 minut
	es of clean\, hilarious comedy that the whole family can enjoy. Bargatze’s
	 storytelling style draws you in from the first minute and keeps you laugh
	ing until the very end. \nThis is the matinee show at 3:00 PM. A second sh
	ow at 7:00 PM is also available on the same day. Arrive early to find your
	 seats and enjoy the arena atmosphere before the show begins. \nTicket Inf
	ormation\nPrice Range: Starting from $57 (fees may apply) \nSecure your se
	ats through the official Ticketmaster link or find resale tickets through 
	VividSeats for flexible options. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps
	://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour-live-at
	-van-andel-arena-matinee/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour
	-live-at-van-andel-arena-matinee/
