DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nJay Ph
	aroah is one of the most electrifying comedians working today — a shape-sh
	ifting stand-up\, actor\, and master impressionist who spent six seasons o
	n Saturday Night Live\, where his pitch-perfect takes on Barack Obama\, Ja
	y-Z\, Denzel Washington\, and Will Smith left audiences in awe. His abilit
	y to inhabit characters with uncanny accuracy is matched only by his sharp
	\, personal storytelling. \nOnstage\, Pharoah fuses quicksilver impression
	s with real-life misadventures and pop culture commentary\, toggling effor
	tlessly between celebrity voices and his own authentic comedic voice. He h
	eadlined the Showtime special Can I Be Me? and starred in Showtime’s White
	 Famous\, executive produced by Jamie Foxx. More recently\, he voiced Juni
	or Evans in Netflix’s 2024 animated Good Times and appeared in the films S
	pinning Gold and The Blackening. \nPharoah continues to headline comedy cl
	ubs across the country\, delivering high-energy performances that blend im
	pressions\, storytelling\, and genuine comedic brilliance. His Pittsburgh 
	Improv show promises to be an unforgettable night of laughs. \nEvent Detai
	ls\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nShow Time: 6:30 PM EDT\nDoors Open
	: 5:00 PM EDT\nVenue: Pittsburgh Improv\, 166 East Bridge St\, Homestead\,
	 PA 15120\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\nAge Restriction: 21+ (
	Valid photo ID required)\nSeating: General admission\, first-come first-se
	rved (except groups and premium booths)\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Pittsburgh
	 Improv is Pittsburgh’s premier stand-up comedy club\, located at 166 East
	 Bridge Street in Homestead\, PA — just minutes from downtown Pittsburgh. 
	Part of the nationally renowned Improv Comedy Club chain\, the Pittsburgh 
	Improv has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy in an intimate\, clu
	b-style setting that puts fans close to the action. \nThe venue features a
	 full-service bar and restaurant\, with a mandatory two-item minimum purch
	ase per person in the showroom. Seating is general admission and first-com
	e\, first-served\, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best sea
	ts. Premium VIP booths are available for groups of four and include a $200
	 food and beverage credit. The club has a strict no-photography and no-vid
	eo-recording policy during performances. \nThe intimate atmosphere of the 
	Pittsburgh Improv makes every show feel personal — you’re close enough to 
	see every expression and reaction from the performer\, creating a comedy e
	xperience that larger venues simply can’t match. \nWhat to Expect\nJay Pha
	roah’s Pittsburgh Improv show is a full stand-up comedy performance featur
	ing his signature blend of celebrity impressions and personal storytelling
	. This is a 21+ event\, so bring your valid photo ID. The show runs approx
	imately 90 minutes and is packed with energy from start to finish. \nExpec
	t Pharoah to cycle through his legendary impression repertoire — from Bara
	ck Obama to Jay-Z to Denzel Washington — while weaving in sharp observatio
	ns about life\, pop culture\, and his own experiences. This is an intimate
	 club show\, meaning the crowd interaction and energy will be unlike anyth
	ing you’d experience at a larger venue. Arrive early to grab a drink\, fin
	d your seat\, and soak in the atmosphere before the show begins. \nTicket 
	Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $95 (plus fees\; VIP Premium Booth $95/tic
	ket for groups of 4) \nTickets are limited — the Pittsburgh Improv is an i
	ntimate venue and shows sell out quickly. Secure your seats now before the
	y’re gone. Note: Ticket resale is strictly prohibited by the Pittsburgh Im
	prov\; purchase only through official channels. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResa
	le Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if 
	you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sale
	s are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID required for ent
	ry (21+ event).\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/jay-pharoah-live-at-pi
	ttsburgh-improv-august/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jay-pharoah-live-at-pittsburgh-improv-
	august/
