SUMMARY:Kevin Nealon LIVE at The Wilbur
DTSTAMP:20260731T111640Z
DTSTART:20260801T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nKevin Nealon is one of the most beloved comedians and entertainers in
	 America. Best known as a cast member of Saturday Night Live for nine seas
	ons\, Kevin became a household name through his iconic characters and Week
	end Update anchor role. He later starred as Doug Wilson in the hit Showtim
	e series Weeds for eight seasons\, cementing his status as one of comedy’s
	 most versatile talents. \nKevin’s stand-up is sharp\, observational\, and
	 brilliantly crafted — the kind of comedy that feels effortless and natura
	l while delivering laugh after laugh. His live shows are warm\, engaging\,
	 and packed with the kind of material that only comes from decades of expe
	rience at the top of the comedy world. \nSeeing Kevin Nealon live at The W
	ilbur is a rare opportunity to experience one of comedy’s true legends up 
	close and personal. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nT
	ime: 7:00 PM ET\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116\nT
	ickets from: $45\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most be
	loved and intimate comedy venues\, located in the heart of the Theater Dis
	trict at 246 Tremont Street. With a capacity of approximately 1\,000 guest
	s\, The Wilbur offers an up-close and personal experience that is perfect 
	for Kevin’s warm and conversational performance style. \nThe venue feature
	s excellent sightlines from every seat\, a full bar\, and a warm\, histori
	c atmosphere that makes every show feel special. Originally built in 1914\
	, The Wilbur has been lovingly restored and is now one of the premier come
	dy destinations on the East Coast. \nParking is available at nearby garage
	s in the Theater District\, and the venue is easily accessible via the MBT
	A Green and Orange Lines at Boylston and Back Bay stations. \nWhat to Expe
	ct\nExpect a hilarious\, warm\, and thoroughly entertaining evening of sta
	nd-up comedy as Kevin Nealon takes the stage at The Wilbur. This is a solo
	 performance showcasing Kevin’s signature blend of observational humor\, p
	ersonal storytelling\, and the kind of effortless comedic timing that has 
	made him one of the most respected performers in the business. \nSuitable 
	for audiences 16 and older. A perfect summer night out for fans of classic
	\, brilliantly crafted stand-up comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets from
	 $45. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale ticket
	s via VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalend
	ar.com/event/kevin-nealon-live-at-the-wilbur/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/kevin-nealon-live-at-the-wilbur/
