SUMMARY:Jay Leno LIVE at Route 66 Casino
DTSTAMP:20260731T111640Z
DTSTART:20260801T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout Jay Leno\nJay Leno is o
	ne of the most iconic figures in American comedy. Best known as the longti
	me host of The Tonight Show with Jay Leno\, he held the coveted late-night
	 throne for over two decades\, becoming a household name across generation
	s. \nBefore his television fame\, Leno built his reputation as a tireless 
	stand-up comedian\, performing hundreds of shows per year across the count
	ry. His comedy style is clean\, observational\, and accessible — blending 
	sharp wit with everyman humor that resonates with audiences of all ages. \
	nLeno is also a passionate car enthusiast\, and his love of automobiles of
	ten finds its way into his material. Whether he’s riffing on current event
	s\, everyday life\, or his legendary car collection\, Jay Leno delivers a 
	masterclass in stand-up comedy every time he takes the stage. \nEvent Deta
	ils\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM (Doors open ea
	rlier)\nVenue: Route 66 Casino\, 14500 Central Ave SW\, Albuquerque\, NM 8
	7121\nTicket Prices: $55 – $524+ (resale prices vary)\nAge Restrictions: A
	ll ages welcome\; some seating areas may be 21+\n\nAbout Route 66 Casino\n
	Route 66 Casino is one of New Mexico’s premier entertainment destinations\
	, located just west of Albuquerque along historic Route 66 at 14500 Centra
	l Ave SW. Owned and operated by the Laguna Development Corporation\, the c
	asino features a vibrant entertainment venue that regularly hosts national
	ly touring comedians\, musicians\, and performers. \nThe casino’s showroom
	 offers a comfortable\, intimate atmosphere with excellent sightlines from
	 virtually every seat. The venue is known for its warm hospitality\, full-
	service bar\, and easy access from I-40. Ample free parking is available o
	n-site\, making it a convenient night out for locals and visitors alike. \
	nWith its Southwestern flair and top-notch amenities\, Route 66 Casino pro
	vides the perfect backdrop for a memorable evening of live entertainment. 
	Guests can enjoy dining options\, gaming\, and cocktails before and after 
	the show. \nWhat to Expect\nJay Leno’s live stand-up show is a polished\, 
	high-energy performance that showcases why he’s remained one of America’s 
	most beloved comedians for over 40 years. Expect a solo headlining set fil
	led with sharp observational humor\, timely commentary on pop culture and 
	current events\, and plenty of laughs from start to finish. \nThis is a se
	ated\, reserved show — so you can sit back\, relax\, and enjoy the perform
	ance in comfort. Leno is known for his clean\, crowd-pleasing material tha
	t works for date nights\, family outings\, and groups of friends alike. \n
	Arrive early to grab drinks\, explore the casino floor\, and find your sea
	ts before showtime. This is a one-night-only performance\, so don’t miss y
	our chance to see a true comedy legend live in Albuquerque. \nTicket Infor
	mation\nTickets for Jay Leno at Route 66 Casino start at $55 and go up to 
	$524+ for premium and VIP seating. Tickets are available through Ticketmas
	ter (official) and VividSeats (resale marketplace). \n\nOfficial TicketsRe
	sale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission i
	f you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sa
	les are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be require
	d for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/jay-leno-live-at-route-ca
	sino/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jay-leno-live-at-route-casino/
LOCATION:Route 66 Casino\, 14500 Central Ave SW\, Albuquerque\, New Mexico\
	, 87121\, United States
