DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nRocky Dale Davis LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Clu
	b\nViral comedian Rocky Dale Davis brings his high-energy stand-up to Jimm
	y Kimmel’s Comedy Club at The LINQ on the Las Vegas Strip on August 1\, 20
	26. With over 500 million views on TikTok and Instagram\, Rocky Dale Davis
	 is one of the hottest rising stars in comedy — and this is your chance to
	 see him live! \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 7:
	30 PM PT (9:30 PM show also available)\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\
	nAddress: 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109 (at The LINQ Promen
	ade)\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid photo ID\nParking: Available at Harr
	ah’s\, Flamingo\, LINQ\, and surface lot \nAbout Rocky Dale Davis\nRocky D
	ale Davis is a stand-up comedian whose viral videos on TikTok and Instagra
	m have amassed over 500 million views and 1 million followers. Known for h
	is relatable\, high-energy humor\, Rocky has appeared on E!’s Dating No Fi
	lter and NBC’s Bring The Funny\, and is quickly becoming one of the most t
	alked-about comedians in the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHeadlining stand
	-up set by Rocky Dale Davis\nHigh-energy\, viral-style comedy\nIntimate sh
	owroom setting at The LINQ Promenade\n18+ show with adult humor\nMultiple 
	show times available (7:30 PM & 9:30 PM)\nOne of TikTok’s most-watched com
	edians live on stage\n\nVenue Information\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is l
	ocated at The LINQ Promenade on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering an intimate
	 and lively comedy experience steps away from the High Roller observation 
	wheel and some of Vegas’s best dining and entertainment. \nTicket Informat
	ion\nTickets start from $62. Must be 18 and older to attend. Bags are subj
	ect to search upon entry. Reserved seats are subject to change if you arri
	ve 15 minutes after the show begins. There is a 20-ticket limit per order.
