SUMMARY:Max Amini LIVE at Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas
DTSTAMP:20260731T111640Z
DTSTART:20260801T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nMax Amini is one of the most exciting and fastest-rising comedians in
	 the world — a world-renowned stand-up comedian\, producer\, director\, an
	d podcaster who has redefined what it means to be a global comedy star in 
	the digital age. Born in Tucson\, Arizona\, and raised with Iranian herita
	ge\, Max has built a comedy empire from the ground up\, amassing over 25.7
	 million followers and an astonishing 5.8 billion views in 2025 alone\, ma
	king him the most-watched comedian on Instagram globally. \nMax made histo
	ry as the first Iranian-American artist to headline Madison Square Garden 
	and sell out the Kia Forum in Los Angeles. His 2025 tour spanned 19 countr
	ies\, 60 cities\, and 150 sold-out shows\, with over 200\,000 tickets sold
	. His stand-up special Randomly Selected reached 16 million views in under
	 six months. Known for his brilliant crowd work\, cultural storytelling\, 
	and magnetic stage presence\, Max calls his live shows a “United Nations o
	f Comedy” — bringing audiences of all backgrounds together for an unforget
	table night of laughter. \nThis one-night-only performance at the Encore T
	heater at Wynn Las Vegas is a rare chance to see one of comedy’s biggest g
	lobal stars up close in an intimate Las Vegas setting. \nEvent Details\n\n
	Date: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Encore Theater at 
	Wynn Las Vegas\nAddress: 3121 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nNot
	e: One night only. Meet & Greet VIP packages available.\n\nAbout the Venue
	\nThe Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas is one of the most intimate and pre
	stigious entertainment venues on the Las Vegas Strip. Located inside the l
	uxurious Wynn Las Vegas resort at 3121 S Las Vegas Blvd\, the Encore Theat
	er seats approximately 1\,600 guests and is celebrated for its exceptional
	 acoustics\, elegant design\, and the up-close\, personal atmosphere it cr
	eates for every performance. \nThe Encore Theater has hosted some of the b
	iggest names in comedy and entertainment\, including Sebastian Maniscalco\
	, Jerry Seinfeld\, Jimmy Carr\, and now Max Amini. Its intimate layout ens
	ures that every seat feels close to the stage — making it one of the best 
	venues in Las Vegas for a stand-up comedy show. \nValet and self-parking a
	re available at Wynn Las Vegas. The resort offers world-class dining\, sho
	pping\, and casino entertainment\, making it easy to turn a Max Amini show
	 into a full luxury Las Vegas evening. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo st
	and-up performance by Max Amini — one night only at the Encore Theater. Ex
	pect a high-energy\, crowd-interactive show packed with Max’s signature cu
	ltural storytelling\, brilliant improvisation\, and the kind of universal 
	humor that has made him a global phenomenon. Max is famous for his incredi
	ble crowd work — no two shows are ever the same. \nVIP Meet & Greet packag
	es are available for fans who want to meet Max after the show. Whether you
	’re a longtime fan or discovering him for the first time\, this is a show 
	that will leave you laughing and wanting more. \nTicket Information\nPrice
	 Range: $75 – $200 \nTickets available through Ticketmaster (official) and
	 VividSeats (resale). VIP Meet & Greet packages also available. Grab your 
	seats before they sell out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://co
	medycalendar.com/event/max-amini-live-encore-theater-wynn-las-vegas-august
	/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/max-amini-live-encore-theater-wynn-las
	-vegas-august/
LOCATION:Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas\, 3131 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Veg
	as\, NV\, 89109\, USA
